Applying the change suggested by Steffen shows a further problem: NCCS
must be removed from the CC_FIELDS list. (NCCS is the first invalid index
for POSIX::Termios::getcc().)

The nature of the original problem is that as written, CC_FIELDS is
populated only with VEOF, so the other fields in the code never got
saved and restored.

I suggest the patch below which adds the commas and removes NCCS, and also
adds a test to verify that there is more than one entry in CC_FIELDS.

Hugo
--- ReadPassword.pm.old	2005-10-25 19:56:02.000000000 +0100
